  {
    "id": "enc-2d4b2345-4fc0-4b8d-bd11-49e6935af917",
    "content": "HPI: Symptoms worsened, rash appeared\n\nSymptoms:\n- Increased coughing\n- Reports fever\n\nSigns:\n- New skin rash.",
    "source_node_id": "enc-2d4b2345-4fc0-4b8d-bd11-49e6935af917",
    "metadata": {
      "eoc_id": "eoc-4c6444dc-4b19-4467-84cf-71b67833987e",
