  {
    "id": "enc-f4ce6b6f-8ca1-4f19-8685-52bcd3115115",
    "content": "Differential Diagnosis: Atypical Pneumonia vs. Drug Reaction\n\nWorsening condition suggests initial diagnosis may be incomplete or incorrect. Rash could be an adverse reaction to Amoxicillin",
    "source_node_id": "enc-f4ce6b6f-8ca1-4f19-8685-52bcd3115115",
    "metadata": {
      "eoc_id": "eoc-4c6444dc-4b19-4467-84cf-71b67833987e",
      "date_issued": "2025-12-08T00:00:00",
      "event_tag": "Diagnosis",
      "category": "Consultation",
      "is_diagnosis": true,
      "diagnosis_type": "Differential",
      "normality": "Abnormal",
      "priority": "High",
      "father_id": "enc-2d4b2345-4fc0-4b8d-bd11-49e6935af917",
      "relationship_type": "association"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "enc-81323a4e-0f87-4bea-83fa-addca75855f2",
    "content": "Adverse Drug Reaction to Amoxicillin confirmed\n\nRash identified as an allergic reaction to penicillin-class antibiotics",
    "source_node_id": "enc-81323a4e-0f87-4bea-83fa-addca75855f2",
    "metadata": {
      "eoc_id": "eoc-4c6444dc-4b19-4467-84cf-71b67833987e",
      "date_issued": "2025-12-09T00:00:00",
      "event_tag": "Allergy/Adverse",
      "category": "Allergy",
      "is_diagnosis": false,
      "diagnosis_type": null,
      "normality": "Abnormal",
      "priority": "High",
      "father_id": "enc-f4ce6b6f-8ca1-4f19-8685-52bcd3115115",
      "relationship_type": "association"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "enc-024e551d-110e-4c55-ac07-d2bc66e8ef20",
    "content": "Final Diagnosis: Mycoplasma Pneumonia\n\nAmoxicillin stopped. Based on the persistent cough and confirmed drug allergy, Atypical Pneumonia is the most likely diagnosis. Further tests confirm Mycoplasma",
    "source_node_id": "enc-024e551d-110e-4c55-ac07-d2bc66e8ef20",
    "metadata": {
      "eoc_id": "eoc-4c6444dc-4b19-4467-84cf-71b67833987e",
      "date_issued": "2025-12-10T00:00:00",
      "event_tag": "Diagnosis",
      "category": "Consultation",
      "is_diagnosis": true,
      "diagnosis_type": "Final",
      "normality": "Abnormal",
      "priority": "High",
      "father_id": "enc-81323a4e-0f87-4bea-83fa-addca75855f2",
      "relationship_type": "association"
    }
  },
  {
    "id": "enc-217fd29f-51ca-42c5-a081-3a8b8fecc266",
    "content": "Prescribed Azithromycin\n\nChanged antibiotic to Azithromycin which is effective against Atypical Pneumonia",
    "source_node_id": "enc-217fd29f-51ca-42c5-a081-3a8b8fecc266",
